WEBVTT

00:02.060 --> 00:04.330
Subaru, are you all right?

00:06.690 --> 00:08.250
Have you calmed down, I suppose?

00:08.250 --> 00:09.480
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:09.480 --> 00:11.740
I just got a bit light-headed.

00:12.620 --> 00:13.820
Thank—

00:12.620 --> 00:13.820
Thank you!

00:14.700 --> 00:15.930
I'm sorry!

00:16.410 --> 00:18.980
<i>Did I Return by Death?</i>

00:18.980 --> 00:22.200
Whew, you gave me a scare, Natsuki-sama!

00:22.200 --> 00:27.080
I don't have much practice 
with requiems, you know...

00:27.480 --> 00:30.540
<i>Wait, no way! This place,
this conversation... Did I...</i>

00:33.110 --> 00:35.510
<i>go back to right before that?!</i>

00:35.910 --> 00:38.470
I gotta hurry! Beatrice!

00:38.810 --> 00:40.010
Come with m—

00:40.010 --> 00:40.890
<i>No!</i>

00:41.430 --> 00:44.310
<i>Petelgeuse was relentless 
when he went after Emilia.</i>

00:44.310 --> 00:48.340
<i>And since Sirius is a fellow 
Sin Archbishop, she'll also...</i>

00:48.340 --> 00:49.820
What's the problem?

00:51.240 --> 00:53.650
You want something sweet, same as me, right?

00:54.690 --> 00:56.370
Stay with Emilia.

00:56.900 --> 00:59.410
Something you can't say to 
Betty again, I suppose?

00:59.410 --> 01:00.770
Sorry.

01:00.770 --> 01:04.830
But if anything happens,
you're the first one I can turn to.

01:05.220 --> 01:08.390
Anyway, I could use a run 
for a change of pace.

01:08.390 --> 01:09.880
I'll grab some drinks on my way.

01:11.280 --> 01:12.260
Subaru!

01:13.330 --> 01:14.920
Please be careful.

01:14.920 --> 01:16.950
Don't do anything reckless, all right?

01:16.950 --> 01:20.010
Yeah, of course.
Just wait here, and trust me.

01:20.640 --> 01:22.350
I'll protect you myself.

01:23.540 --> 01:25.510
Right. Take care.

01:25.510 --> 01:26.140
Sure.

01:28.150 --> 01:30.150
Careful now!

03:17.780 --> 03:19.420
<i>She's not here!</i>

03:19.420 --> 03:23.280
<i>Wait, did she make him chain himself up?!</i>

03:23.280 --> 03:25.050
You okay, Lusbel?!

03:25.050 --> 03:25.890
That's enough!

03:25.890 --> 03:27.070
You can stop now!

03:27.070 --> 03:29.300
You don't need to do this anymore!

03:29.300 --> 03:35.020
B-But... I have to keep 
my promise... or Tina...

03:36.500 --> 03:37.820
Tina will...

03:39.310 --> 03:40.560
It's okay!

03:40.560 --> 03:43.920
There are lots of people in this 
town that you can rely on.

03:43.920 --> 03:47.660
Y-You're gonna be fine... so... so just...

03:48.460 --> 03:51.260
Damn it, legs! Stop shaking!

03:55.440 --> 03:56.650
Lusbel!

04:02.000 --> 04:05.140
For you to show such fear

04:05.610 --> 04:08.390
is proof of how kind you are.

04:15.850 --> 04:17.860
Thank you! I'm sorry!

04:18.270 --> 04:22.030
People can understand each other.
People can be as one.

04:22.030 --> 04:25.650
One is not kind for one's own sake.

04:25.650 --> 04:28.950
Kindness shines because 
it is meant for others!

04:29.360 --> 04:32.040
Ah! That means it is love!

04:34.690 --> 04:38.010
Feel your love to the fullest!

04:38.010 --> 04:42.140
The pure and noble ways that made 
you wish to save Subaru-kun!

04:47.300 --> 04:52.730
You will kindly feel Lusbel-kun's 
fear along with him.

04:53.970 --> 04:56.890
And the fear of Lusbel-kun's that you feel,

04:56.890 --> 04:59.650
Lusbel-kun feels again through you!

05:00.110 --> 05:02.610
<i>Everything I see scares me.</i>

05:02.610 --> 05:04.650
<i>Darkness still scares me so much,
my body's frozen.</i>

05:02.610 --> 05:05.820
And that further fear you feel...

05:04.650 --> 05:05.820
The whole world is made of fear.

05:05.820 --> 05:09.580
<i>Fear alone is the truth of this world, and it
is needed in order to know the value of life.</i>

05:07.620 --> 05:09.580
You must accept it all yet again.

05:09.580 --> 05:13.460
<i>Trembling in fear like this is human.
 It's nothing to be ashamed of.</i>

05:10.060 --> 05:13.460
The joy, the sadness, the fear,

05:13.460 --> 05:16.470
the agony of being hung by the neck...

05:13.460 --> 05:16.470
<i>Of course, such a reaction would be meaningless.
It's only a process.</i>

05:16.470 --> 05:18.400
<i>But by repeating such thought experiments,</i>

05:16.470 --> 05:20.640
Until death teaches you what love is!

05:18.400 --> 05:20.640
<i>can I not fight and defeat the fear
 that still rules my entire body?</i>

05:20.640 --> 05:21.630
<i>If not, then why am I...</i>

05:21.630 --> 05:24.090
<i>I'm scared. I'm scared. I'm scared.
Everything scares me.</i>

05:21.630 --> 05:24.090
It looks like you've reached your limit.

05:24.090 --> 05:28.050
<i>I'm scared to live. I feel sick.</i>

05:24.090 --> 05:28.050
Then let us seek Tina-chan's 
assistance next.

05:29.120 --> 05:30.580
You two...

05:31.810 --> 05:33.810
have done very well.

05:35.930 --> 05:38.190
And after the song, we'll have a nice chat!

05:38.750 --> 05:40.790
Natsuki-sama, don't you 
think you should prepare

05:40.790 --> 05:43.760
some snacks for us to 
enjoy during that time?

05:46.270 --> 05:47.580
Wh-What?

05:47.580 --> 05:49.820
Don't just ask "what"!

05:49.820 --> 05:51.690
You can't just do that out of nowhere!

05:51.690 --> 05:54.010
That's right! Before we even 
talk about the violence,

05:54.010 --> 05:57.500
we should be advising you to 
lose that ugly wink, I suppose.

05:58.090 --> 06:00.830
Was I that ugly?!

06:00.830 --> 06:02.620
I feel sick.

06:02.620 --> 06:04.730
Subaru, are you all right?

06:04.730 --> 06:05.710
Y-Yeah...

06:06.400 --> 06:08.960
<i>Move on! Move on! Move on!</i>

06:08.960 --> 06:11.930
<i>I don't have time to waste! I have to hurry!</i>

06:12.890 --> 06:14.600
<i>But it's no use going alone.</i>

06:14.910 --> 06:16.680
This is how you wink.

06:14.910 --> 06:18.060
<i>And I can't go without a plan. I need help.</i>

06:16.680 --> 06:18.060
Like this?

06:18.060 --> 06:20.770
<i>Who's strong enough to beat Sirius, 
isn't affected by authorities,</i>

06:21.120 --> 06:23.320
<i>and can be at the square in ten minutes...</i>

06:24.560 --> 06:25.820
Reinhard!

06:26.690 --> 06:28.080
Give it a rest!

06:28.080 --> 06:30.070
Please! It's an emergency!

06:30.070 --> 06:31.440
Screw that!

06:31.440 --> 06:35.050
I don't want the red-haired asshole 
talkin' shit to me again! Beat it!

06:35.050 --> 06:36.790
Oh, damn it!

06:36.790 --> 06:40.040
Rachins, I am not joking here!

06:40.040 --> 06:41.750
In less than five minutes...

06:42.200 --> 06:43.000
she's gonna...

06:47.190 --> 06:50.430
People from the Witch's Cult might be here!

06:56.590 --> 06:59.900
Where the hell did you hear that?

07:00.370 --> 07:04.140
Wait, didn't you kill the Sloth 
Archbishop from the Witch's Cult?

07:04.770 --> 07:09.490
Damn it! Lettin' magic loose in town 
for no reason is against city law!

07:09.490 --> 07:12.000
You're gonna apologize with me!

07:15.660 --> 07:17.040
Look at that!

07:17.040 --> 07:17.870
Pretty!

07:17.870 --> 07:19.360
That should...

07:19.360 --> 07:23.130
That was such a lovely light! Thank you!

07:24.100 --> 07:26.340
And now, everyone...

07:26.720 --> 07:29.880
Good morning!

07:29.880 --> 07:31.260
No! Don't look!

07:31.260 --> 07:33.150
Hey! Rachins!

07:33.590 --> 07:38.260
Well, you all went quiet much 
more quickly than I expected!

07:38.260 --> 07:42.770
It must be thanks to the two of you 
for turning their attention to me!

07:42.770 --> 07:44.860
Thank you! Applause!

07:51.570 --> 07:55.950
And it took 21 seconds for 
all of you to look at me.

07:55.950 --> 07:58.910
I'm sorry! But this is so wonderful!

07:59.300 --> 08:02.410
Now, I must introduce myself!

08:02.950 --> 08:07.380
I am the Sin Archbishop in the 
Witch's Cult representing wrath...

08:07.380 --> 08:13.180
Sirius Romanée-Conti.

08:16.830 --> 08:21.450
Thank you! I'm sorry for 
taking up your time!

08:21.450 --> 08:25.850
But don't worry. This will 
all be over very soon.

08:25.850 --> 08:26.810
Will it?

08:28.900 --> 08:33.240
In that case, I should finish 
this quickly, as well.

08:35.550 --> 08:37.360
Sorry I was late getting here.

08:37.360 --> 08:39.370
It took a bit of time to 
find the shortest route.

08:39.990 --> 08:42.120
I understand why you called me here.

08:42.550 --> 08:44.870
You made the right choice, Rachins.

08:45.160 --> 08:47.610
Or was it you, Subaru?

08:49.290 --> 08:50.560
Reinhard!

08:52.040 --> 08:53.770
Yes, it's me.

08:53.770 --> 08:55.550
Looks like things were getting bad.

08:56.020 --> 08:57.870
That's a Sin Archbishop, right?

08:57.870 --> 09:02.850
Yeah... She... She has the 
power to brainwash people.

09:02.850 --> 09:03.800
I see.

09:04.460 --> 09:05.850
Wait a moment there...

09:06.240 --> 09:10.470
You, with the red hair... Are you 
the famous Master Swordsman?

09:10.470 --> 09:11.780
Yes, I am.

09:11.780 --> 09:16.150
Though, sadly, I am aware that I 
have not yet earned that title.

09:16.500 --> 09:19.730
Hang on, Reinhard! You don't 
wanna keep talking to her!

09:19.730 --> 09:22.620
So it would seem. It's the true 
reason I was called here.

09:23.180 --> 09:24.820
I will take care of this problem.

09:25.580 --> 09:27.570
Oh, what an unexpected—

09:29.840 --> 09:33.010
Reinhard! She's all yours!

09:33.010 --> 09:35.520
Oh, how overwhelming!

09:36.430 --> 09:38.220
Chains, eh? That's a pain.

09:46.270 --> 09:47.980
You are too wonderful!

09:49.280 --> 09:51.270
Your skills are impressive, as well.

09:51.270 --> 09:55.070
It's a true shame you're 
using them for evil.

09:58.280 --> 10:00.300
Let's go! We can't stay here!

10:00.300 --> 10:01.950
B-But Tina...

10:01.950 --> 10:03.740
Getting out of here comes first!

10:03.740 --> 10:19.570
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

10:19.570 --> 10:24.850
Becoming one like this... 
Is that not what love is?!

10:24.850 --> 10:30.800
And if so, then is this not the perfect 
paradise that can only be born of love?

10:30.800 --> 10:32.690
Do you have any last words?

10:32.690 --> 10:37.070
Thank you! I'm sorry! But I 
have just one warning for you.

10:37.510 --> 10:41.160
The other Sin Archbishops are 
not as quiet and tame as me,

10:41.160 --> 10:45.110
so if you ask them for their 
last words, you will suffer.

10:45.110 --> 10:47.080
I'll keep that in mind.

10:48.650 --> 10:51.630
<i>Something's wrong! I have to stop... him...</i>

10:52.250 --> 10:56.960
Understanding each other, compromising, 
recognizing each other, talking things out...

10:56.960 --> 11:01.430
Becoming one by doing these things is 
the shape that love is meant to take!

11:01.430 --> 11:02.830
Reinhard!

11:05.310 --> 11:06.260
Kill her!

11:10.640 --> 11:14.110
Oh, this kind world...

11:23.360 --> 11:24.620
No...

11:30.490 --> 11:33.030
And after the song, we'll have a nice chat!

11:33.030 --> 11:34.960
Natsuki-sama, don't you 
think you should prepare

11:34.960 --> 11:37.880
some snacks for us to 
enjoy during that time?

11:37.880 --> 11:39.720
Ow, ow, ow!

11:39.720 --> 11:42.410
That hurts! That hurts, Subaru!

11:43.500 --> 11:47.430
What happened? Why'd you suddenly 
try to crush the little girl's hand?

11:47.430 --> 11:50.310
Oh, you poor girl! Let me 
lick it better for you.

11:50.310 --> 11:51.910
No one asked you, I suppose!

11:51.910 --> 11:53.970
Stay away from me!

11:51.910 --> 11:53.970
<i>That's the third time...</i>

11:53.970 --> 11:55.770
<i>Even Reinhard couldn't do it?</i>

11:55.770 --> 11:57.770
Subaru, are you all right?

11:57.770 --> 11:59.990
Y-Yeah, it's nothing!

11:59.990 --> 12:03.520
Well, you enjoy her song, Emilia-tan!

12:03.520 --> 12:05.770
Yeah! Enjoy my song!

12:05.770 --> 12:08.760
Beako, you're going shopping with me.

12:08.760 --> 12:10.560
Let's get nice and cozy.

12:10.560 --> 12:12.760
Wh-Where is this coming fr—

12:15.240 --> 12:16.640
All right, fine.

12:17.790 --> 12:20.580
Emilia-tan! I'll be right back, okay?

12:20.580 --> 12:21.840
All right!

12:27.760 --> 12:30.930
Would you tell me what's 
going on now, I suppose?

12:31.320 --> 12:34.940
The Witch's Cult is gonna show 
up at the square we're going to.

12:35.440 --> 12:36.400
The Witch's Cult?

12:38.080 --> 12:41.360
There's no reason to look so worried.

12:41.830 --> 12:44.950
You don't need to tell me what you 
learned and where, I suppose.

12:45.330 --> 12:49.660
You told me. That's all 
the proof Betty needs.

12:50.170 --> 12:53.750
Beatrice... You really are 
gonna be the one who saves me.

12:53.750 --> 12:55.600
Hmph! Of course, I suppose!

12:55.600 --> 12:57.540
Now, tell me whatever you can.

12:58.000 --> 12:59.630
Okay, well...

12:59.630 --> 13:02.380
It's the Sin Archbishop 
of Wrath that shows up.

13:02.730 --> 13:07.590
And her power is something like...
the sharing of feelings and sensations.

13:07.590 --> 13:10.830
To put it briefly, it makes you 
unable to recognize danger.

13:10.830 --> 13:13.430
And how does the sharing of sensations work?

13:13.430 --> 13:16.880
If she feels pain, you feel it exactly the same.

13:16.880 --> 13:18.900
If the Sin Archbishop's head is cut off,

13:18.900 --> 13:21.190
everyone watching loses their heads, too.

13:22.990 --> 13:24.960
What the hell can we do?

13:24.960 --> 13:27.200
This is why I need your strength and wisdom.

13:27.770 --> 13:31.700
I haven't ruled out getting Reinhard 
to fight with us as a last resort...

13:31.700 --> 13:33.430
That won't work, I suppose.

13:33.430 --> 13:34.660
It won't? Why?

13:34.660 --> 13:37.390
Because of his physical nature.

13:37.390 --> 13:39.630
If I stand on the same 
battlefield as Reinhard,

13:39.630 --> 13:42.730
Betty would be no more than a 
cute little girl, I suppose.

13:42.730 --> 13:43.340
Huh?

13:43.700 --> 13:47.360
To this world, Reinhard is the 
very definition of "different."

13:47.360 --> 13:52.100
Simply by existing, he makes all 
mana around him blindly obey him.

13:52.450 --> 13:56.220
He renders users of magic and spirits 
alike unable to use their powers.

13:56.220 --> 13:57.670
He can do that?

13:58.460 --> 14:00.860
So you and I are gonna have 
to handle this alone...

14:00.860 --> 14:04.980
Subaru, there may yet be 
a way to resolve this.

14:04.980 --> 14:06.440
Really? How?

14:06.440 --> 14:09.380
I'll be blunt. This is a 
job for Shamac, I suppose.

14:09.910 --> 14:11.920
Shamac time!

14:11.920 --> 14:17.370
Shamac separates the will of a spell's 
target from the rest of the world.

14:17.930 --> 14:21.120
In other words, if all those within 
range of the enemy's technique

14:21.120 --> 14:23.000
are brought into Shamac at once...

14:23.000 --> 14:26.500
That's it! Shamac might really 
be able to fix any problem!

14:26.500 --> 14:29.470
I don't know what makes you 
trust it so, I suppose.

14:29.470 --> 14:33.620
Hang on! I won't let anyone badmouth Shamac!
Not even you, Beako!

14:33.620 --> 14:37.230
Seriously, what is making you say all this?

14:38.080 --> 14:41.550
Anyway, if we can nullify 
her technique, we win!

14:41.550 --> 14:42.690
And then...

14:42.690 --> 14:45.690
All that's left is to defeat her, I suppose.

14:45.690 --> 14:47.680
Yeah, that's the problem.

14:47.680 --> 14:50.660
It sounds like this is where I come in.

14:51.920 --> 14:53.990
Emilia-tan! Why...

14:54.370 --> 14:57.120
I thought you were acting 
strange. I was right!

14:57.440 --> 15:00.380
I'm certain he told you to wait in the park.

15:00.380 --> 15:01.680
Bad girl, I suppose.

15:01.680 --> 15:04.990
I'm sorry. I had every intention of waiting,

15:04.990 --> 15:06.500
but Priscilla said...

15:06.500 --> 15:08.680
That girl in red?

15:08.680 --> 15:11.570
"If you don't go after him now,
 you might regret it."

15:11.570 --> 15:14.520
I intended to go back if nothing was wrong,

15:15.320 --> 15:18.890
but the Witch's Cult is going 
to show up, right? I heard.

15:18.890 --> 15:22.230
Emilia-tan, I'm glad you feel 
that way... I am, but...

15:22.230 --> 15:25.120
You can tell me to go back, but I won't.

15:25.120 --> 15:27.790
The Witch's Cult is my business,
 too, you know.

15:27.790 --> 15:29.070
Emilia!

15:32.400 --> 15:34.730
Pretending to be angry won't do any good.

15:34.730 --> 15:38.490
I only feel bad when scolded 
if I've done something wrong.

15:38.960 --> 15:42.640
You're the one who's being 
unreasonable right now, not me.

15:43.670 --> 15:48.370
I know you're doing this 
to try to keep me safe.

15:48.370 --> 15:52.770
But I refuse to stand by with my eyes 
closed while you get hurt doing it.

15:52.770 --> 15:55.810
When you fight, I fight.

15:55.810 --> 15:59.460
If you're going to protect someone,
 I'll help you.

15:59.460 --> 16:02.100
Because in the same way you protect me...

16:02.500 --> 16:05.060
I want to protect you, too.

16:05.060 --> 16:08.540
Because even now, you look 
like you're going to cry.

16:10.230 --> 16:12.780
Subaru, you might as well give up.

16:13.380 --> 16:16.330
Betty understands how 
Emilia feels, I suppose.

16:16.330 --> 16:18.500
So I don't want to try to convince her.

16:20.810 --> 16:23.390
The Witch's Cult is gonna 
come after you for sure.

16:23.390 --> 16:26.800
Whatever you do, put your own safety first.

16:26.800 --> 16:28.480
All right, I will.

16:28.480 --> 16:31.260
And if I do get caught, I have 
faith that you'll rescue me.

16:31.790 --> 16:34.290
Don't jinx me like that.

16:34.800 --> 16:36.850
There she is! That's the Witch's—

16:36.850 --> 16:37.680
Ul Huma!

16:39.640 --> 16:41.200
E-Emilia-tan?

16:41.200 --> 16:44.130
I thought I should make the 
first move. Was that wrong?

16:44.130 --> 16:47.940
No, good job! It was just... 
more than I expected, so...

16:47.940 --> 16:49.570
Beako, do you think that got her?

16:49.570 --> 16:53.700
Well, for starters, 
everyone here thinks you did, I suppose.

16:53.700 --> 16:54.630
Huh?

16:54.630 --> 16:57.700
Oh, uh... I didn't do this 
for any insidious reasons!

16:58.110 --> 16:59.200
We just...

16:59.200 --> 17:01.440
Don't, Subaru. Stay behind me.

17:01.440 --> 17:03.410
Their eyes aren't normal.

17:03.750 --> 17:06.310
Beako, got Shamac ready?

17:06.310 --> 17:07.830
We blew it.

17:07.830 --> 17:09.890
This is heresy, I suppose.

17:09.890 --> 17:14.120
It's spiritual interference,
closer to a curse or hex than a spell.

17:14.120 --> 17:16.480
Shamac will be useless 
against it, I suppose.

17:16.480 --> 17:17.300
It stinks.

17:17.300 --> 17:19.260
It stinks, it stinks!

17:19.260 --> 17:23.270
It stinks, it stinks, it stinks, it stinks, 
it stinks, it stinks, it stinks, it stinks!

17:24.350 --> 17:27.610
I smell it! I smell it! I smell the girl!

17:27.610 --> 17:32.480
The foul stench of the filthy, infuriating
half-devil who would take him from me!

17:32.480 --> 17:34.110
Oh, how infuriating!

17:34.110 --> 17:37.700
Just taking him from me 
isn't enough for you?!

17:37.700 --> 17:39.240
Filthy half-devil!

17:41.580 --> 17:46.460
I am the Sin Archbishop in the 
Witch's Cult representing wrath,

17:46.460 --> 17:49.710
Sirius Romanée-Conti!

17:50.030 --> 17:52.270
You infuriating half-devil scum!

17:52.270 --> 17:56.960
I'm going to burn you alive and scatter 
your ashes over my husband's grave!

17:56.960 --> 18:00.180
She wasn't acting anything like this before!

18:00.180 --> 18:03.920
Like maggots that just keep 
coming back when I burn them...

18:03.920 --> 18:06.430
What is it you've got against me, huh?!

18:06.430 --> 18:09.280
Am I not even free to mourn?!

18:09.280 --> 18:11.940
How long?! How long?!

18:11.940 --> 18:15.110
I have no idea what you're talking about.

18:15.690 --> 18:18.320
If you're angry with me, tell me why.

18:18.720 --> 18:22.280
I'm the one who attacked first, so it's 
only natural that you'd be angry.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.880
But the other people here 
have nothing to do with it.

18:24.880 --> 18:25.790
Set them free.

18:25.790 --> 18:28.500
Don't take that patronizing tone 
when asking me for a favor!

18:28.500 --> 18:31.840
If it's only natural for me 
to be angry, then apologize!

18:31.840 --> 18:33.960
Crawl on the ground begging 
for my forgiveness!

18:33.960 --> 18:37.440
Do that and I'll cook your intestines 
right through your ass!

18:37.440 --> 18:39.380
I guess talking just doesn't work with you!

18:39.380 --> 18:42.680
In that case, I have an idea of my own!

18:48.690 --> 18:50.150
Half-devil scum!

18:50.150 --> 18:52.810
Stop insulting me over and over!

18:54.230 --> 18:56.190
Take that, you—

18:58.530 --> 18:59.530
There!

19:04.870 --> 19:06.290
You are so annoying!

19:12.210 --> 19:13.250
You bitch!

19:13.250 --> 19:15.530
Half-devil! Maggot!

19:15.530 --> 19:17.570
You are infuriating! Maddening!

19:17.570 --> 19:18.580
She's pushing her back...

19:19.220 --> 19:21.680
You maggot!

19:21.680 --> 19:23.680
Emilia! Keep dragging this out!

19:24.330 --> 19:26.180
We can't afford to be too reckless!

19:26.180 --> 19:28.020
Right! Beako!

19:28.930 --> 19:29.970
Murac!

19:35.980 --> 19:38.040
Don't bite your tongue, Beako!

19:43.490 --> 19:45.190
Lusbel! You okay?!

19:48.660 --> 19:49.870
Tina...

19:52.190 --> 19:55.180
That overflowing passion is 
the trembling of the heart!

19:57.000 --> 19:58.590
Wrath!

19:59.960 --> 20:03.470
Eyes that seduce men! A voice 
like a bell to seduce men!

20:03.470 --> 20:05.930
Shining silver hair to seduce men!

20:05.930 --> 20:08.180
Ah, how repulsive!

20:08.180 --> 20:11.390
You are so determined to take him from me,

20:11.390 --> 20:13.350
you homewrecker?!

20:15.360 --> 20:17.650
Stop saying these strange things!

20:17.650 --> 20:20.670
My eyes, my voice, and my silver hair

20:20.670 --> 20:23.290
are all things the person I love praised!

20:23.290 --> 20:26.570
That makes me the same as the 
most amazing woman in the world!

20:26.970 --> 20:29.830
You talking about them like 
that has made me angry!

20:29.830 --> 20:33.480
Angry?! <i>You</i> are angry?! Don't be ridiculous!

20:33.480 --> 20:37.000
That belongs to me!

20:39.460 --> 20:44.640
He gave it to me! And you 
want to take it from me!

20:44.640 --> 20:48.050
Stop it! Stop it, stop it, 
stop it, stop it, stop it!

20:58.770 --> 21:00.010
Tina!

21:03.550 --> 21:07.070
That wrath is wasted on you!

21:13.540 --> 21:14.540
Emilia!

21:14.540 --> 21:17.680
A bug has no right to embrace 
such exquisite fury.

21:17.680 --> 21:19.000
You nauseate me.

21:19.570 --> 21:22.550
Thank you! I'm sorry!

21:23.000 --> 21:23.920
Emilia!

21:24.310 --> 21:26.260
Subaru! Don't!

21:27.580 --> 21:29.640
I made it in time.

21:38.090 --> 21:39.400
You're...

21:39.400 --> 21:42.180
I'm here to take her back.

21:42.180 --> 21:44.650
I sure am glad I got here in time.

21:45.570 --> 21:46.610
Take her back?

21:46.610 --> 21:49.530
Isn't it my job as a man—as a human—

21:49.530 --> 21:53.580
to take the hand of the 
woman I'm going to marry?

21:55.870 --> 22:00.060
I am the Sin Archbishop in the 
Witch's Cult representing greed,

22:00.060 --> 22:02.050
Regulus Corneas.

22:02.760 --> 22:05.470
As promised, I will be taking her

22:05.470 --> 22:09.970
<b>A Showdown of Fire and Ice</b>

22:06.160 --> 22:09.470
as my 79th wife.
